    "sourceContentHtml": "<h3 id=\"get-it-now\" tabindex=\"-1\">Get it now! <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"https://phils.app/blog/philsdictationapp/\">#</a></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Try it online here: <a href=\"https://speech.phils.app\">🎙️https://speech.phils.app</a></li>\n<li>Buy it from the <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/store/apps/9NTPHH45FFRN\" class=\"with-svg\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-grid\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect>\n</svg>Microsoft Store</a>.</li>\n<li>It's open-source on <a href=\"https://github.com/stedwick/philsdictationapp\" class=\"with-svg\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github\"><path d=\"M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3\n        1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85\n        1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4\"></path><path d=\"M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2\"></path>\n</svg>GitHub</a>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
