  {
    "id": "privacy",
    "title": "👀 Privacy Policy",
    "url": "https://phils.app/blog/privacy/",
    "datePublished": "2023-12-03T00:00:00Z",
    "description": "Privacy Policy for Phil's Dictation App.",
    "tags": [
      "policies"
    ],
    "contentText": "Phil doesn't track you # Phil (that's me) doesn't track anything about you. However, your voice is recorded by Microsoft to perform the speech-to-text transcription in Phil's Dictation App (or Apple/Google depending on your browser and operating system). You can read Microsoft's stance on privacy here: https://privacy.microsoft.com Apple's here: https://www.apple.com/privacy And Google's here: https://policies.google.com/privacy",
    "sourceContentHtml": "<h2 id=\"phil-doesn-t-track-you\" tabindex=\"-1\">Phil doesn't track you <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"https://phils.app/blog/privacy/\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Phil (that's me) doesn't track anything about you. However, your voice is recorded by Microsoft to perform the speech-to-text transcription in Phil's Dictation App (or Apple/Google depending on your browser and operating system).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can read Microsoft's stance on privacy here: <a href=\"https://privacy.microsoft.com\">https://privacy.microsoft.com</a></li>\n<li>Apple's here: <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/privacy\">https://www.apple.com/privacy</a></li>\n<li>And Google's here: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"phil-doesn-t-track-you\" tabindex=\"-1\">Phil doesn't track you <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"https://phils.app/blog/privacy/\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Phil (that's me) doesn't track anything about you. However, your voice is recorded by Microsoft to perform the speech-to-text transcription in Phil's Dictation App (or Apple/Google depending on your browser and operating system).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can read Microsoft's stance on privacy here: <a href=\"https://privacy.microsoft.com\">https://privacy.microsoft.com</a></li>\n<li>Apple's here: <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/privacy\">https://www.apple.com/privacy</a></li>\n<li>And Google's here: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
    "links": [
      {
        "label": "https://privacy.microsoft.com",
