    "id": "riptoast",
    "title": "🐶 Toast the Dog passes away",
    "url": "https://phils.app/blog/riptoast/",
    "datePublished": "2023-11-16T00:00:00Z",
    "description": "My best friend Toast died peacefully in his sleep this morning.",
    "tags": [
      "dogs",
      "Toast"
    ],
    "contentText": "My best friend Toast died peacefully in his sleep this morning. He was 10 years old. We adopted him in NYC and had many adventures together. Rest in Peace # I'll remember you forever, Toast <3",
    "sourceContentHtml": "<p>My best friend Toast died peacefully in his sleep this morning. He was 10 years old. We adopted him in NYC and had many adventures together.</p>\n<p><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.avif 600w, https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-1200.avif 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.webp 600w, https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-1200.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.jpeg 600w, https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-1200.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><img alt=\"Phil &amp; Toast in PDX\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://phils.app/img/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"899\"></picture>\n<picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-600.avif 600w, https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-1200.avif 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-600.webp 600w, https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-1200.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-600.jpeg 600w, https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-1200.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><img alt=\"Phil &amp; Toast in PDX\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://phils.app/img/l4Q2A3-zer-600.jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\"></picture></p>\n<h2 id=\"rest-in-peace\" tabindex=\"-1\">Rest in Peace <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"https://phils.app/blog/riptoast/\">#</a></h2>\n<p>I'll remember you forever, Toast &lt;3</p>\n",
    "contentHtml": "<p>My best friend Toast died peacefully in his sleep this morning. He was 10 years old. We adopted him in NYC and had many adventures together.</p>\n<p><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.avif 600w, /blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-1200.avif 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.webp 600w, /blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-1200.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"/blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.jpeg 600w, /blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-1200.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><img alt=\"Phil &amp; Toast in PDX\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/blog/Cy-pZpHUg8-600.jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"899\"></picture>\n<picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/blog/l4Q2A3-zer-600.avif 600w, /blog/l4Q2A3-zer-1200.avif 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/blog/l4Q2A3-zer-600.webp 600w, /blog/l4Q2A3-zer-1200.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><source type=\"image/jpeg\" srcset=\"/blog/l4Q2A3-zer-600.jpeg 600w, /blog/l4Q2A3-zer-1200.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 600px) 600px, 100vw\"><img alt=\"Phil &amp; Toast in PDX\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/blog/l4Q2A3-zer-600.jpeg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\"></picture></p>\n<h2 id=\"rest-in-peace\" tabindex=\"-1\">Rest in Peace <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"https://phils.app/blog/riptoast/\">#</a></h2>\n<p>I'll remember you forever, Toast &lt;3</p>\n",
